output.content:
     1|/**
     2| * Investor-first home feed — renders the CANONICAL block sequence from
     3| * GET /api/ivx/video-platform/home-feed (same source of truth as the landing
     4| * page and iOS app):
     5| *
     6| *   Deal 1 (InvestmentCard) → Deal 2 (InvestmentCard) → Deal 3 (InvestmentCard)
     7| *   → 1 Featured Project Video (CanonicalInvestmentReelCard) → repeat.
     8| *
     9| * Deal blocks render as compact InvestmentCard (carousel + metrics + CTAs).
    10| * Video blocks render as CanonicalInvestmentReelCard (full-bleed reel).
    11| * No deal is ever rendered as a reel — explicit display_type mapping.
